scene quiet
  camera    5.0 1.0 17.0
  look      0.230 0.115 68
  tonemap   reinhard
  exposure  1.0
  bloom     0.00 1.00
  dust      0 drift box 0 0.7 1.0
  stars     0 off 1.0 1.0
  note      the instrument, on its own
end
